│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ phase_to_population_rx_ring                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the terminal RZ layer with RX rotations and close the CZ chain into a ring.       │
│                          │ Terminal RZ gates commute with the diagonal feature encoding and cannot directly change   │
│                          │ the final Z readout, especially making the last block's post-RZ parameters ineffective.   │
│                          │ RX gates instead convert phase-dependent coherences generated by IsingZZ and CZ           │
│                          │ operations into measurable Z populations, while retaining the same parameter count. The   │
│                          │ added parameter-free CZ edge [7, 0] removes endpoint asymmetry and gives all eight qubits │
│                          │ equal entangling degree, which better matches the complete set of 28 pairwise binary      │
│                          │ features.                                                                                 │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0676                                                                                   │
