│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ close_entangling_ring                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ Add a CZ connection between qubits 7 and 0 to turn the open entangling chain into a ring. │
│                          │ The current chain gives endpoint qubits a weaker correlation pathway even though the      │
│                          │ feature map treats all qubits as participants in pairwise phase features and the readout  │
│                          │ weights every qubit equally. Closing the ring removes this boundary bias, improves global │
│                          │ phase-information propagation, and adds no trainable parameters, preserving parameter     │
│                          │ efficiency while potentially improving validation accuracy and convergence.               │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
