│ patch_description        │ Share each qubit’s pre- and post-entanglement RY angle within a block, reducing the model │
│                          │ from 24 to 16 unique parameters per block and total parameters from 146 to 98. This       │
│                          │ recurrent local rotation regularizes the circuit while retaining the useful               │
│                          │ RY–RZ–entangle–RY structure that previously improved convergence. Add a CZ between wires  │
│                          │ 7 and 0 to remove endpoint asymmetry and form a ring, improving global information flow   │
│                          │ for the permutation-balanced mean-Z readout without adding trainable parameters.          │
