│ patch_description        │ Replace the over-parameterized ring ansatz with a permutation-symmetric block aligned to  │
│                          │ the mean-Z readout and all 28 pairwise feature couplings. Sharing each local rotation     │
│                          │ across all qubits reduces the block from 24 to 4 unique parameters, lowering the full     │
│                          │ model from 146 to 26 parameters and providing strong regularization. Complete-graph CZ    │
│                          │ entanglement removes the arbitrary ring bias and previously demonstrated substantially    │
│                          │ better validation accuracy and loss. A trainable CRZ on the central 3-4 link adds a       │
│                          │ low-cost adaptive two-qubit phase interaction, allowing the circuit to tune entanglement  │
│                          │ rather than relying exclusively on fixed CZ phases.                                       │
