│ patch_description        │ Replace the overparameterized, topology-biased skip-chain block with a                    │
│                          │ permutation-symmetric block tailored to the dataset’s 28 pairwise features and mean-Z     │
│                          │ readout. Sharing each rotation angle across all qubits reduces the circuit from 146 to 20 │
│                          │ total parameters, improving optimization speed, parameter efficiency, and regularization. │
│                          │ A complete-graph CZ layer exposes every encoded qubit pair to the same entangling         │
│                          │ structure, avoiding arbitrary locality assumptions and matching the strongest prior       │
│                          │ result, which achieved 0.95 validation accuracy, 0.26 validation loss, and a 0.94         │
│                          │ combined score.                                                                           │
