│                          │ coupling every encoded feature pair. A single central CRY adds a parameter-efficient,     │
│                          │ noncommuting symmetry-breaking channel that can convert learned phase correlations into   │
│                          │ measurable populations more directly than CRZ, while avoiding a large increase in         │
│                          │ optimization dimension.                                                                   │
