│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ symmetric_crz_bridge                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the heavily over-parameterized ring ansatz with a permutation-shared              │
│                          │ complete-graph block, then add one adaptive CRZ on the suggested critical 6–7 bridge.     │
│                          │ Shared pre/post rotations regularize the six independent block copies and align with      │
│                          │ mean-Z pooling, while complete-graph CZ coupling mirrors all 28 pairwise feature          │
│                          │ channels. The shared RX layer supplies noncommuting basis mixing, and the localized CRZ   │
│                          │ adds trainable two-qubit expressivity without sacrificing parameter efficiency. This      │
│                          │ reduces the model from 146 to 32 total parameters and builds directly on the strongest    │
│                          │ prior complete-graph candidate.                                                           │
