│ patch_description        │ Replace the overparameterized local-line ansatz with a permutation-regularized block      │
│                          │ aligned to the symmetric mean-Z readout and the 28 pairwise feature channels. Sharing     │
│                          │ three rotation parameters and one controlled-phase parameter reduces the model from 146   │
│                          │ to 26 total parameters, which should improve generalization and Adam efficiency.          │
│                          │ Complete-graph CZ coverage distributes every encoded pair interaction, while two central  │
│                          │ CRZ gates on [3,4] and [2,5] reuse the same parameter to add adaptive phase expressivity  │
│                          │ without increasing parameter count. This structure is supported by the prior candidate’s  │
│                          │ substantially higher validation accuracy, lower loss, and zero generalization gap.        │
