│ patch_description        │ Replace the overparameterized, qubit-specific ring ansatz with a symmetry-aligned block   │
│                          │ using only four parameter keys per block. Shared RY/RZ layers regularize the six          │
│                          │ independent upload/repeat copies and match the permutation-symmetric mean-Z readout.      │
│                          │ Complete-graph CZ connectivity mirrors all 28 pairwise feature channels, while two        │
│                          │ central CRZ gates share one parameter to add adaptive phase interactions without extra    │
│                          │ parameter cost. This reduces total parameters from 146 to 26 and should improve           │
│                          │ validation accuracy, generalization, L2 loss, and optimization efficiency.                │
